nnaturali e poteri spaventosi."},{"language":"en-US","title":"A Writer's Odyssey","overview":"Lu Kongwen is the author of a fantasy novel series following a heroic teenager, also named Kongwen, on a quest to end the tyrannical rule of Lord Redmane, under the guidance of a Black Armor. But through a strange twist of fate, the fantasy world of the novel begins to impact life in the real world, leading Guan Ning to accept a mission from Tu Ling to kill the author.","tagline":"Rewrite the reality."},{"language":"zh-CN","overview":"异世界皇都，天神赤发鬼残暴统治、滥杀无辜。少年空文遭到赤发鬼追杀，在黑甲的指引下奋起反击，踏上凡人弑神之路。然而，这一切只是小说家路空文笔下的奇幻世界，而小说中的故事进程竟开始影响现实。与此同时，为寻找失踪女儿的关宁接下了刺杀路空文的任务。随着小说与现实逐渐交织，两个世界的命运也开始彼此影响……","tagline":"只要相信 就能实现"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iul7zWHU6guBOI846vuHTybOoHj.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vnH8IHc0202E8h2UtdpEe2ILjF0.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":611698,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iul7zWHU6guBOI846vuHTybOoHj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iul7zWHU6guBOI846vuHTybOoHj.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iul7zWHU6guBOI846vuHTybOoHj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iul7zWHU6guBOI846vuHTybOoHj.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5EYx6YJb6iYnJQgpZ0WnY70FdME.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5EYx6YJb6iYnJQgpZ0WnY70FdME.jpg","language":"it","width":850,"height":1274}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7hEhhmAF8Tr7g95fkbuxDpeR27b.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7hEhhmAF8Tr7g95fkbuxDpeR27b.jpg","language":